# Served by the Gateway, which checks the operator identity and forwards it to
# the custody owner. The operator confirms that an UNKNOWN custody's hand is
# empty, after their own open-hand and return-home commands. It is checked when
# it arrives: the custody becomes EMPTY only if fresh feedback then shows an
# empty hand settled at the robot's configured home (not one from the custody
# record); otherwise it is refused (WRONG_STATE) and nothing is remembered.
# Bound to custody_id and custody_epoch; idempotent per request_id.
uint32 schema_version
string request_id
string custody_id
string custody_epoch
bool operator_confirmed_empty
string operator_note
# Only report the current custody (custody_id, state, reason_code); change nothing.
bool inspect_only
---
bool success
# Why it was refused (held_custody_contract.CUSTODY_ERRORS, or the Gateway's own
# admission codes); empty on success.
string error_code
string message
string custody_id
# The custody's state and reason after the request (HeldObject.state / reason_code).
string state
string reason_code
